# Line endings.
#
# Added 2026-09-16 with the Docker deployment, and it is a correctness matter
# rather than tidiness: a shell script checked out with CRLF fails on Linux
# with `bad interpreter: /bin/sh^M`. `docker/entrypoint.sh` runs on every
# container start, so getting this wrong is a container that restart-loops
# before it ever serves a request - and it would only happen for whoever
# checked the repository out on Windows with core.autocrlf=true, which is the
# default there.
#
# Normalize everything text in the repository, then force LF on the files that
# are executed rather than read.
* text=auto

*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
docker/**/*.conf text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf

# Binary, so git never tries to "fix" them.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.mp4 binary
*.ttf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
